    "Off by default. Find copies in ⌘K: type “clip”. Text up to 64 KB, images up to 5 MB and files are kept, in memory only unless you keep them across restarts (images never are). Never recorded: items apps mark as private, anything copied while secure keyboard entry is on, and copies from the apps below. %@V can open it from anywhere (see Shortcuts). Pasting into the app you were in needs Accessibility; without it, ↩ copies and you press ⌘V.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. Find copies in ⌘K: type “clip”. Text up to 64 KB, images up to 5 MB and files are kept, in memory only unless you keep them across restarts (images never are). Never recorded: items apps mark as private, anything copied while secure keyboard entry is on, and copies from the apps below. %@V can open it from anywhere (see Shortcuts). Pasting into the app you were in needs Accessibility; without it, ↩ copies and you press ⌘V."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. When on, VibeCheck asks api.ipify.org (over HTTPS) for your address at most every 10 minutes and when your network changes. That service sees your IP, as any website does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. When on, VibeCheck asks api.ipify.org (over HTTPS) for your address at most every 10 minutes and when your network changes. That service sees your IP, as any website does."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: Claude Code shows its local 5-hour estimate. When on, VibeCheck asks your Claude Code for your plan usage every 5 minutes, the same data /usage shows. No model request, no Keychain access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: Claude Code shows its local 5-hour estimate. When on, VibeCheck asks your Claude Code for your plan usage every 5 minutes, the same data /usage shows. No model request, no Keychain access."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: a small cup appears in the vibe ring while a session runs. On: a separate item, always shown. Click it to start or stop, using the length in “Start sessions for” above. Right-click (or ⌥-click) for every option.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: a small cup appears in the vibe ring while a session runs. On: a separate item, always shown. Click it to start or stop, using the length in “Start sessions for” above. Right-click (or ⌥-click) for every option."
          }
        }
      }
    },
